title: "MAWRID: Smart Decentralized Water Reuse"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Team"
    given-names: "MAWRID"
abstract: "A concept-stage, safety-oriented system for treating source-separated ablution greywater toward monitored non-potable reuse using low-energy filtration, date-palm-derived biochar, controlled disinfection, condition-based maintenance, and fail-safe diversion."
